{
  "activity": "AppendRangeX",
  "package": "UiPath.Excel.Activities",
  "coded": [
    {
      "when": [
        "StartingColumnName"
      ],
      "call": "{DestinationRange}.AppendRange",
      "args": {
        "source": "{SourceRange}",
        "columnName": "{StartingColumnName}",
        "transpose": "{Transpose}",
        "pasteOptions": "UiPath.Excel.CopyPasteRangeOptions.{PasteOptions}",
        "destinationHasHeaders": "{DestinationHasHeaders}",
        "excludeSourceHeaders": "{HasHeaders}"
      },
      "defaults": {
        "Transpose": false,
        "PasteOptions": "All",
        "DestinationHasHeaders": false,
        "HasHeaders": false
      },
      "usings": [
        "UiPath.Excel.Activities.API",
        "UiPath.Excel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "call": "{DestinationRange}.AppendRange",
      "args": {
        "source": "{SourceRange}",
        "transpose": "{Transpose}",
        "pasteOptions": "UiPath.Excel.CopyPasteRangeOptions.{PasteOptions}",
        "excludeSourceHeaders": "{HasHeaders}"
      },
      "defaults": {
        "Transpose": false,
        "PasteOptions": "All",
        "HasHeaders": false
      },
      "usings": [
        "UiPath.Excel.Activities.API",
        "UiPath.Excel"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ignore": [
    "DestinationHasHeaders"
  ],
  "notes": "ExcelOperations.AppendRange の 3 つのオーバーロードのうち、StartingColumnName があれば columnName 付き（destinationHasHeaders もここで渡す）、無ければ transpose / pasteOptions / excludeSourceHeaders だけの形。HasHeaders（元の範囲に見出しがある）は excludeSourceHeaders に対応させた（見出し行を貼り付けから外す）。DestinationHasHeaders は StartingColumnName が無い形では Coded に渡す先が無いので捨てる"
}
